{"at":"2026-02-27T18:29:32.149Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":640,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-your-leads/","title":"Leads & Enquiries","description":"How do Leads & Enquiries work?","body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\"><h1>Leads &amp; Enquiries</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10238\" class=\"elementor elementor-10238\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7dd7913f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7dd7913f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43bcd031 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"43bcd031\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Turn interest into opportunity!</strong> Master the art of managing leads, from direct inquiries to MLS agency referrals.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-18c0626 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"18c0626\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1cdeae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f1cdeae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:117\"><a href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PropertyList.es</a> fuels your sales pipeline with a powerful lead generation system:</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:114\"><strong>All captured leads are automatically converted into contacts, ready to be added to your <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/sales-pipeline-tracking/how-to-use-pipeline/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">pipeline</a>.</strong></p>\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-7:0\">\n<li data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:103\"><strong>MLS LEADS:</strong> Connect with qualified clients referred by fellow agents on the MLS platform.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"6:1-7:0\"><strong>MICROSITE LEADS:</strong> Capture enquiries from direct potential clients through your <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/microsite-share/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Branded MicroSite.</a></li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"6:1-7:0\"><strong>PORTAL LEADS:</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"http://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PropertyList.es</a> public property portal generates qualified direct leads right to you!<br><br>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"><strong>No matter where they come from, all your leads are conveniently collected in one place for easy management, follow-up and overview.</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:123\">This comprehensive approach ensures a steady stream of leads being managed easily, allowing you to focus on converting them into happy clients.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:123\">Happy Hunting!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\"><br></div>\n\t\t    </div>\n    </article>","seo_title":"Leads & Enquiries • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":"How do Leads & Enquiries work on PropertyList.es MLS"}}